{
  "part": 3,
  "title": "Fourteen Floors",
  "lines": [
    {"id": "P3-L01", "text": "The water drained out of the streets.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L02", "text": "Fifteen minutes. Maybe less.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L03", "text": "They waded through knee-deep mud.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L04", "text": "Mia slipped. Ravi pulled her up.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P3-L05", "text": "The tower's main door was blocked.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L06", "text": "The fire stairs. Fourteen floors.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.8},
    {"id": "P3-L07", "text": "Far out, the horizon turned white.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L08", "text": "“Don't look back,” Ravi said.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L09", "text": "Floor five. Floor six.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.3},
    {"id": "P3-L10", "text": "Mia's legs gave out.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L11", "text": "He carried her the rest of the way.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L12", "text": "Floor twelve. The roar arrived.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L13", "text": "They reached the roof as the wave hit.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.9},
    {"id": "P3-L14", "text": "Ravi threw himself over Mia.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L15", "text": "The wave exploded against the tower.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P3-L16", "text": "Water climbed past floor after floor...", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P3-L17", "text": "and stopped two floors below them.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1.0},
    {"id": "P3-L18", "text": "Silence.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.9},
    {"id": "P3-L19", "text": "They waited. Day one.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L20", "text": "Day two. The water began to fall.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L21", "text": "Day three. Nobody came.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1.0},
    {"id": "P3-L22", "text": "Then, on the third night, Mia heard something.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L23", "text": "Far away. High in the sky.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L24", "text": "Listen!", "speaker": "mia", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P3-L25", "text": "She lifted the flashlight.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.3},
    {"id": "P3-L26", "text": "Three short. Three long. Three short.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 2.3},
    {"id": "P3-L27", "text": "A red helicopter broke through the clouds.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L28", "text": "Its searchlight blinked back.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.5},
    {"id": "P3-L29", "text": "Same code.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.6},
    {"id": "P3-L30", "text": "Help had finally come.", "speaker": "narrator"}
  ],
